    "description": "<p>When Fair Folk threaten Creation, the Stewards deny them ground--and sustenance. With a mere touch, the Lunar dims all sense of a single target's emotions, desires and Virtues. For (Lunar's Essence) days, a mortal target benefits from +1 Mental Defense Value, the difficulty to read the target's mental state increases by one and the target becomes proof against any attempt to consume his Virtues for sustenance, as the Fair Folk do. This Charm only works on mortals; the Stewards can look out for themselves.</p>",
